# Google Maps API Key — powers merchant business-address lookup/verification in Settings.
# Optional: the app runs fine without it (address editing is simply disabled and shows a notice).
#
# To enable:
#   1. Create a project at https://console.cloud.google.com/
#   2. Enable "Places API" and "Maps JavaScript API"
#   3. Enable billing on the project (required by Google Maps Platform)
#   4. Create an API key under APIs & Services > Credentials
#   5. (Recommended) Restrict the key to HTTP referrers for your domains
#
# Note: keys created after March 1, 2025 use the new Places API
# (AutocompleteSuggestion / Place), which this app already targets.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
